<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰγ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be a Magus</i> or <i>skilled in Magian lore</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Art.</u>
				3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>use magic arts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1338
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταγαγεῖν τὸν Δία μαγεύσαντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Num.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> trans.,
				<i>bewitch</i>, e.g. by philtres, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				5.22
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Clearch.
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				54
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέπλον μεμαγευμένον φαρμάκοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					1.9.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>call forth by magic arts</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμψυχα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.57
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
